le_name": "2023-01-26_16-34-26.mkv_snapshot_01.18.466_1440.png", "id": "3465087683770757", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974780_3465087687104090_5745773893023703044_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QuUmzWbRMZkQ7kNvwF3YiJG&_nc_oc=AdlcyGNsKr3zxmSRPnaG8AhjL4mbgNGkomDuGJBkzbOrd6Xc1hi99y1ICoxI1_QpLjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw44EHwfvQZmK78ePECcKwBk436HGUq45juney5uY7bBw&oe=69B2D060"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-01-54.mkv_snapshot_00.25.826_1440.png", "id": "495260649347486", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974891_495260652680819_1612014108408918328_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EBGQp_aqpP4Q7kNvwHmxB5-&_nc_oc=AdmB4c2akNiSzBXqTNxQ8ZNzBIdpVFilCL50-024FaHmSV-nWBNCLjP6Cqfxzoe_ytk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzcB15_hcrDvTauASmb0LIb-Qgh_owSz3PQP6wdMvYb6g&oe=69B2BF43"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-57-00.mkv_snapshot_01.20.540_1440.png", "id": "910860627004003", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974801_910860630337336_8867062962642311624_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DH_xX3N1t3AQ7kNvwGNA6vE&_nc_oc=Adm5ufmQZ8BtTSy_YfvSn-oQDrPzow129R4BxMmMpx1hxpXT90MiLfTRgugdqwR44eQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzHOT4v2Xm-RF4WYzjOWl36p896KF4PvDZCne_lS8SUOg&oe=69B2B0BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Unification_release-trailer_thumbnail_quest.png", "id": "222585180139802", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003238_222585183473135_4209265122119070746_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m8h2aa6dIWwQ7kNvwEOYa2L&_nc_oc=AdnFSz8JUW9NtzA0146pv4LetHKTsxoFqR3mk2DA9HkaIgR34mdEOw_AkWsTyGSC984&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzDKTZV1cOBZOgAlaz7I3P8-KcY_O90Lek0uy0frizkcQ&oe=69B2A465"}, "display_name": "Unification", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fluid and powerful physics-based movement: Feel momentum and the wind rushing past while leaping into chasms, vaulting over ledges, weaving around traps, and shifting gravity at will.\n- Kinetic tools propelling you forward: Swing above traps with a grappling hook, or glide past with a parachute. Go in guns blazing with a shotgun, or slice with a katana. Forge a new path with a jackhammer, or warp through with a teleporter.\n- Procedural destructible biomes filled with traps and enemies: Navigate through voxel cave obstacle courses with branching paths that test your reactions, knowledge, and control. Feel free to explore the depths and get lost. The handheld mini-map and conveniently placed teleporters make it easy to quickly get back on track.\n- Dreamlike upgrades: Push the limits of physics and imagination during the journey to the core with fundamental changes to the game mechanics\n- Carefully crafted controls and haptics: Each action is positioned on the controllers to allow effortless simultaneous usage of all movement and tool capabilities, inducing a flow state of control.", "short_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path."}]}, "developer_name": "Troy Spencer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/troyspencer/7c0c9a0f5b23daf767866b9416a145fd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrushPoint Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crushpo